lures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n  - ShipmentControllerTest: 9 tests (5 existing + 4 new, all passing)\n  - OrderControllerTest: 4 tests passing\n  - SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test passing\n  - CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests passing\n\nNot done\nNone. All acceptance criteria met:\n1. Existing build passes\n2. Existing tests pass (all 5 original shipment tests still pass)\n3. POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms created shipments and persists\n4. Error responses consistent (using ApiException hierarchy and GlobalExceptionHandler)\n5. Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled shipment refused; unknown id refused\n6. No new Maven dependencies added\n7. No unrelated production file changes (only shipment feature + core API error codes)\n```","usage":{"total_tokens":32394,"tool_uses":21,"duration_ms":90318},"uuid":"1973e18d-9760-402b-bf21-95b2f9321845","session_id":"63528af4-6e7d-4bb9-8b3e-5e13ba87df0f"}
